menu "Watering Can Pot Module Configuration"

    config WC_POT_MOISTURE_ADC_GPIO
        int "Soil moisture sensor ADC GPIO"
        range 0 54
        default 19
        help
            GPIO wired to the capacitive soil moisture sensor's analog
            output, via the Hat2-Bus header. Must be an ADC-capable pin --
            on esp32p4, that's GPIO 16-23 (ADC1) or 49-54 (ADC2). GPIO
            19-23 are confirmed present on the Hat2-Bus header's pin list
            in hardware_bom.md (and happen to be exactly the ADC1-capable
            range), but the physical header *position* for this GPIO is
            not confirmed -- verify with a multimeter/continuity test
            before trusting the silkscreen, same as earlier GPIO mixups
            in this project.

endmenu
